{"title": "Yeenoghu's Hunger", "pageid": 29255, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Yeenoghu's_Hunger", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Yeenoghu's Hunger</b> is a passive feature that identifies a creature as harboring <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">gnoll</a> spawn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Bloated with the spoils of slaughter, but still hungry - a new gnoll is growing in the hyena's belly. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bloated_Hyena\" title=\"Bloated Hyena\">Bloated Hyena</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">About to give birth to a <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">gnoll</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715000156\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 464/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1932/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1105/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 142/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643670/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.043      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   25.043      1 -total\n 37.49%    9.389      1 Templa